# This repo ships the skill only: SKILL.md, references/, scripts/, assets/sfx/,
# docs/, icons. Every video project built with the skill is a sibling folder
# holding its own script, generated media, stems and rendered MP4s — none of
# that belongs here. Add a line when a new project appears.
ethiopia-alliance/
space-bunny/

# Rendered output and generated audio/video, wherever a project writes them.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.flac
*.wav
!assets/sfx/**/*.wav

# Working artifacts from previews and frame dumps.
stems/
frames/
snapshots/
*.log

# Tooling.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
